    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d961">

                <pb facs="1033" n="1021" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg1021"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Italy)/8–1345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-18T13:00:00-04:00">August 18, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1376. Urtel 2321 [<hi rendition="#italic">2329</hi>], Aug 13. Dept would have no
                    objection to return of Bolzano Province to Ital administration if in opinion of
                    SAC and AC there is no reason for retention of AMG. Ital Govt should be
                    informed, however, that return is without prejudice to final disposition of
                    Bolzano territory.</p>
                <p>It is presumed SAC will recommend to CCS modification of Fan 536<anchor n="20"
                        xml:id="d961-f1"/> before proceeding with this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
